        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;server-build: T0&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Merge requests, a schedule, parity outside skymp-wire, and every push to an m&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;- branch. docker build of ci/server.Dockerfile on upstream's skymp-vcpkg-deps:733f2d5; ctest inside when the five masters download from SKYRIM_DATA_URL (persist's esm/ through Caddy, for sky-ci only); pushes skymp-server:&amp;lt;branch&amp;gt; and :&amp;lt;branch&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;sha&amp;gt;." tooltip="Source: skymp/.gitlab-ci.yml:90-138; skymp/ci/server.Dockerfile:10-11, 51-56; memory thuum-hosting-and-estate.md (SKYRIM_DATA_URL is Caddy's https://thuum.gaussing.tv/persist/esm/, sky-ci only)" id="b1-fp-j5">
