        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;registry:2 on sky-ci, 10.10.70.12:5000&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Jobs push to localhost:5000; sky-srv pulls. skymp-server:&amp;lt;branch&amp;gt; and :&amp;lt;branch&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;sha&amp;gt;; skymp-server:parity-legacy, the last RakNet image (T2's oracle); thuum/lab-api:latest and :&amp;lt;sha&amp;gt;." tooltip="Source: lab/deploy/sky-srv/env.example:5 (REGISTRY); lab/deploy/sky-srv/docker-compose.yml:10, 40, 60, 73; .gitlab-ci.yml:67-82; skymp/.gitlab-ci.yml:132-138; memory thuum-hosting-and-estate.md (a registry:2 container on sky-ci)" id="b1-reg">
