        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;One runner for both projects&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tag sky, docker executor with the host's socket, permanent egress (GitHub, crates.io, vcpkg sources). It takes one job at a time across both projects, first come first served: a thuum push queues its jobs ahead of a fork server-build on a staging's critical path." tooltip="Source: memory thuum-hosting-and-estate.md (2026-10-08: one job at a time across both projects), thuum-m2-poison-visuals.md (2026-10-13: first come first served); .gitlab-ci.yml:1-3; skymp/.gitlab-ci.yml:1-3; docs/LAB.md:133-134 (egress)" id="b1-qnote">
