        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Parity Windows Flatrim (AE/SE)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;parity-windows.yml, runs-on windows-2022. On a push to parity, or workflow_dispatch: an m2-* branch builds only when dispatched. One run per branch: a new one cancels the running one.&lt;br&gt;Upstream's pr_base action, unchanged: skymp5-client (yarn build), CMake with vcpkg (its binary cache kept by actions/cache), the build, ctest.&lt;br&gt;Uploads dist (build/dist: client/ with Skyrim Platform, skymp5-client.js and MpClientPlugin.dll, the Rust wire client; server/; papyrus-vm/), server-dist and more. A failed run uploads no dist." tooltip="Source: skymp/.github/workflows/parity-windows.yml:15-79; skymp/.github/actions/pr_base/action.yml:83-88, 229-268, 319-366, 383-386; docs/WIRE.md:67 (MpClientPlugin.dll is the wire-client-ffi cdylib); skymp/build/dist-client as downloaded 2026-10-13 (client/, server/, papyrus-vm/); memory thuum-hosting-and-estate.md (2026-10-07: a failed run uploads no client artifact)" id="b1-win">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b1-act">
            <mxGeometry x="170" y="39" width="290" height="190" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Formatting check&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;formatting.yml, ubuntu-latest, every push and pull request: upstream's linter, pinned by SHA-256. Fork C++ is held to clang-format 21.1.8; a red here is debt, not a gate." tooltip="Source: skymp/.github/workflows/formatting.yml; memory thuum-hosting-and-estate.md (2026-10-04: clang-format 21.1.8), thuum-m2-poison-visuals.md (2026-10-13: debt, not a gate)" id="b1-fmt">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b1-act">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="39" width="150" height="138" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Prettier&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;prettier.yml, ubuntu-latest, every push and pull request: yarn prettier-check with continue-on-error, so it never fails the run." tooltip="Source: skymp/.github/workflows/prettier.yml" id="b1-pret">
