        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="Eli's Mac reaches the lab only through Caddy's names and the SSH jump root@core.gaussing.tv; licensed game files live on rpool/sky/persist and never enter a repo. Baseline: fork mojibake-dev/skymp at parity c918a7a1, fork branches m2-poison (40ed43a5, on parity) and m2-visuals (0f4e3b75, on m2-poison) in flight, 2026-10-13 (heads at drawing time). Hover a shape for its source." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:96-98, 100-114, 174; justfile:211; CLAUDE.md (just persist-game); git rev-parse and git merge-base in skymp/ (origin/parity c918a7a1, origin/m2-poison 40ed43a5, origin/m2-visuals 0f4e3b75); memory thuum-m2-poison-visuals.md" id="b2-sub">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-1">
