        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;sky-srv, VM 700, 10.10.70.10: Debian 12 with Docker, no internet (images come only from sky-ci)&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:53, 68-72; lab/deploy/sky-srv/README.md:21-22; lab/deploy/sky-srv/docker-compose.yml" id="b2-srv">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B0E3E6;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="b2-vlan">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="27" width="800" height="390" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;lab-api: thuum/lab-api:latest&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;FastAPI on :80 under /lab, host network. One run at a time: it restores the server's world from a snapshot, rolls the clones back through the Proxmox API, waits for their heartbeats, checks their game version, feeds lab-driver its steps, judges the assertions, and writes result.json and the artifacts. Also GET /lab/game, a clone's snapshot and promote, assist and probe; tcpdump and tc netem on the VM's interface." tooltip="Source: lab/labapi/labapi/app.py; lab/labapi/labapi/runner.py:1-4, 191-218, 271-305, 368-451; docs/LAB.md:331-351, 520-557; lab/deploy/sky-srv/docker-compose.yml:72-101" id="b2-la">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-srv">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="25" width="430" height="171" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;skymp-server: skymp-server:${SERVER_TAG}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The lab's server; SERVER_TAG from /srv/lab/.env, compose's default parity. UDP 7777; 3000 for the lab gamemode's labState and labCommand RPCs. World /srv/lab/server/world; masters ESM_DIR, default /srv/persist/esm/1.6.1170." tooltip="Source: lab/deploy/sky-srv/docker-compose.yml:9-32; docs/LAB.md:562-566; lab/labapi/labapi/runner.py:191-201, 271-305" id="b2-sv">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#8C8C8C;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-srv">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="242" width="210" height="138" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Profile difftest (T2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;skymp-server-test (TEST_TAG, the build under test; RPC on 127.0.0.1:3100) and skymp-server-legacy (parity-legacy, the last RakNet image), each on its own world; the fakeclient and difftest run inside the images." tooltip="Source: lab/deploy/sky-srv/docker-compose.yml:34-70; lab/tools/test-proto.sh:1-26, 98-114, 178-196" id="b2-dt">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#8C8C8C;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-srv">
            <mxGeometry x="266" y="242" width="174" height="138" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;/srv/lab on sky-srv&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;docker-compose.yml and .env: REGISTRY, SERVER_TAG, the Proxmox token.&lt;br&gt;server/world: the live world (the file driver).&lt;br&gt;snapshots/: clean, the lab's baseline world; playtest-&amp;lt;label&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;stamp&amp;gt;, Eli's worlds.&lt;br&gt;thuum/lab: the deployed lab tree (just deploy-srv).&lt;br&gt;difftest/: difftest and its sessions (just test-proto).&lt;br&gt;results/: rpool/sky/results over virtio-fs." tooltip="Source: lab/deploy/sky-srv/README.md:5-19; lab/deploy/sky-srv/env.example; justfile:210-230; lab/tools/test-proto.sh:91; lab/tools/playtest-world.sh:7; docs/LAB.md:164-166, 522-538" id="b2-files">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;shape=note;size=12;boundedLbl=1;" vertex="1" parent="b2-srv">
            <mxGeometry x="456" y="25" width="334" height="355" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;sky-c1 and sky-c2&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Windows 11 linked clones of tpl-sky-client (VM 710). Source: docs/LAB.md:57-59, 86-91, 217-243; lab/labapi/labapi/guests.yaml" id="b2-cl">
          <mxCell style="swimlane;horizontal=0;startSize=28;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#B0E3E6;swimlaneFillColor=#B0E3E6;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;" vertex="1" parent="b2-vlan">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="501" width="530" height="378" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Windows 11 linked clones of tpl-sky-client (VM 710)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;sky-c1: VM 711, 10.10.70.21, GTX 1050, client c1, profile 1. sky-c2: VM 712, 10.10.70.22, RTX 5060 Ti, client c2, profile 2. QEMU guest agent; the game is blocked outside 10.10.70.0/24." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:57-59, 244; lab/labapi/labapi/guests.yaml:30-39; lab/deploy/sky-client/README.md:92-106, 248-256" id="b2-c0">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-cl">
            <mxGeometry x="38" y="10" width="482" height="60" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;SkyrimSE 1.6.1170, the default (ADR-025)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;C:\Games\Skyrim Special Edition 1.6.1170 with SKSE 2.2.6; Steam's 1.7.104 folder (SKSE 2.3.1) kept for a smoke. At logon the task sky-lab-launch asks GET /lab/game which folder to start." tooltip="Source: lab/deploy/sky-client/README.md:135-173; docs/DECISIONS.md ADR-022, ADR-025" id="b2-c1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-cl">
            <mxGeometry x="38" y="80" width="482" height="60" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Skyrim Platform and skymp5-client&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The dist from GitHub in every game folder (just client-dist): SkyrimPlatform.dll, MpClientPlugin.dll (the Rust wire client), skymp5-client.js." tooltip="Source: lab/tools/client-dist.sh; skymp/build/dist-client (2026-10-13); docs/WIRE.md:67" id="b2-c2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-cl">
            <mxGeometry x="38" y="150" width="482" height="47" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;lab-driver.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A Skyrim Platform plugin: polls GET /lab/step on each update, runs the step in the game, posts its result to lab-api at http://10.10.70.10/lab." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:315-322; lab/tools/client-driver.sh" id="b2-c3">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-cl">
            <mxGeometry x="38" y="207" width="482" height="47" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Disk snapshots, stacked&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;clean-sp (the RakNet baseline) under clean-m1 under clean-m1-next: lab-api rolls each clone back to clean-m1-next before a run. A staging retakes it; a merge promotes it into clean-m1." tooltip="Source: lab/labapi/labapi/guests.yaml:8-31; docs/LAB.md:219-243, 451-470" id="b2-c4">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-cl">
            <mxGeometry x="38" y="264" width="482" height="60" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Sunshine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Base port 48989 on sky-c1, 49989 on sky-c2." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:175-195; justfile:257-260" id="b2-c5">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-cl">
            <mxGeometry x="38" y="334" width="482" height="34" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;sky-ci, VM 702, 10.10.70.12 (page 1)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Debian 12 with Docker: the GitLab runner thuum-docker and the registry :5000 sky-srv pulls from; permanent egress." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:55, 86-87, 133-134; lab/deploy/sky-srv/env.example:5" id="b2-ci">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B0E3E6;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-vlan">
            <mxGeometry x="560" y="501" width="250" height="60" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;sky-re, LXC 701, 10.10.70.11&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Debian 12, Ghidra 12.1.4 and pyghidra-mcp: project skyrim on persist's ghidra/, one program per exe (SkyrimSE-1.6.1170.0.exe, SkyrimSE-1.7.104.0.exe). just ghidra-import runs analyzeHeadless in a transient unit with pyghidra-mcp stopped. Caddy serves it as ghidra.gaussing.tv/mcp." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:54, 72-85, 108-109; lab/tools/ghidra-import.sh; justfile:72-91" id="b2-re">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B0E3E6;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-vlan">
            <mxGeometry x="560" y="585" width="250" height="112" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Caddy on the host: LAN and tailnet only&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;thuum.gaussing.tv/lab to lab-api (sky-srv:80); /results/&amp;lt;run&amp;gt;/ read-only from rpool/sky/results; /persist/esm/ to sky-ci only (SKYRIM_DATA_URL); ghidra.gaussing.tv/mcp to sky-re:8080." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:100-114; memory thuum-hosting-and-estate.md (/persist/esm/ for sky-ci only, SKYRIM_DATA_URL)" id="b2-caddy">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B0E3E6;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-host">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="106" width="250" height="99" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Proxmox API, https://10.0.0.10:8006&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;lab-api's token lab-api@pve!runner, scoped to pool sky: power, snapshots and rollback, guest agent exec and file read." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:116-121; lab/deploy/sky-srv/env.example:6; lab/deploy/sky-srv/docker-compose.yml:80-84; lab/labapi/labapi/proxmox.py" id="b2-api">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B0E3E6;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-host">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="217" width="250" height="60" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;sshd: the jump, root@core.gaussing.tv&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ssh -J to sky-srv as eli; qm guest exec into a clone; pct exec 701 into sky-re; the persist dataset is written here (persist-game, persist-mods)." tooltip="Source: justfile:78-85, 211-230; lab/tools/client-dist.sh:12; lab/tools/playtest-relaunch.sh:23; lab/tools/persist-game.sh:15-16, 63; lab/tools/persist-mods.sh:64-65" id="b2-jmp">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-host">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="323" width="250" height="73" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;DNAT for Sunshine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;From the LAN and the tailnet, each client's port family one to one: base 48989 to sky-c1, 49989 to sky-c2." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:180-195" id="b2-dnat">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B0E3E6;strokeColor=#0E8088;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-host">
            <mxGeometry x="10" y="889" width="250" height="60" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;rpool/sky/results&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;One folder per run, &amp;lt;UTC stamp&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;scenario&amp;gt;: result.json, server and client logs, screenshots, the world before and after, lab.pcap, Frida traces. Quota 500 GB, pruned after 30 days; at https://thuum.gaussing.tv/results/&amp;lt;run&amp;gt;/. In sky-srv at /srv/lab/results over virtio-fs, read-write, so a rollback never deletes a run." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:106-107, 164-166, 351, 554-557; lab/labapi/labapi/runner.py:117-119" id="b2-res">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=10;spacingTop=12;" vertex="1" parent="b2-host">
            <mxGeometry x="1200" y="54" width="270" height="152" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;rpool/sky/persist (200 GB, snapshotted daily)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;esm/ (1.7.104's masters) and esm/1.6.1170/: the masters and the plugins each version's server loads.&lt;br&gt;game/: the exes, and 1.6.1170's three Steam depots.&lt;br&gt;mods/: the lab's mod layer (just persist-mods).&lt;br&gt;ghidra/: the Ghidra project. pve-root-ca.pem.&lt;br&gt;In sky-srv at /srv/persist, read-only; bind-mounted into sky-re. Licensed files never enter a repo." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:42-44, 167-174; lab/deploy/sky-srv/README.md:16-18; lab/deploy/sky-srv/docker-compose.yml:100; lab/tools/persist-game.sh; lab/tools/persist-mods.sh:52-60; lab/tools/ghidra-import.sh:10; docs/DECISIONS.md ADR-022; memory thuum-hosting-and-estate.md (/srv/persist read-only on sky-srv)" id="b2-per">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=10;spacingTop=12;" vertex="1" parent="b2-host">
            <mxGeometry x="1200" y="230" width="270" height="476.2" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;fenestrate, VM 220, VLAN 60&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Eli's desktop, only ever a file source: just persist-game streams its five masters and the exe through the Mac into persist, hash-checked at both ends. It shares its RTX 5060 Ti with sky-c2; the agent never starts it." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:92-95, 150-151, 244; lab/tools/persist-game.sh:1-17, 60-69; justfile:232-236; memory thuum-hosting-and-estate.md (sky-c2 starts only while fenestrate is off)" id="b2-fen">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="b2-host">
            <mxGeometry x="1200" y="746.2" width="270" height="99" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Eli's Mac&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md:34, 96-98; docs/DECISIONS.md ADR-016" id="b2-mac">
